xt\" href=\"http://www.acm.org/press-room/news-releases-2007/turingaward/\">the original</a> on December 30, 2008<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">October 16,</span> 2008</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=ACM%27S+Turing+Award+Prize+Raised+To+%24250%2C000&amp;rft.pub=ACM+press+release&amp;rft.date=2007-07-27&amp;rft.aulast=Geringer&amp;rft.aufirst=Steven&amp;rft&#95;id=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.acm.org%2Fpress-room%2Fnews-releases-2007%2Fturingaward%2F&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3ATuring+Award\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-10\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-10\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite class=\"citation web cs1\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20151123032706/http://www.acm.org/press-room/news-releases/2014/turing-prize-announcement\">\"ACM's Turing Award Prize Raised to $1 Million\"</a>. <a href=\"/wiki/Association_for_Computing_Machinery\" title=\"Association for Computing Machinery\">Association for Computing Machinery</a>. Archived from <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.acm.org/press-room/news-releases/2014/turing-prize-announcement\">the original</a> on November 23, 2015<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">November 13,</span> 2014</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=ACM%27s+Turing+Award+Prize+Raised+to+%241+Million&amp;rft.pub=Association+for+Computing+Machinery&amp;rft&#95;id=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.acm.org%2Fpress-room%2Fnews-releases%2F2014%2Fturing-prize-announcement&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3ATuring+Award\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-11\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-11\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFZhongkai&#95;ShangguanZihe&#95;ZhengJiebo&#95;Luo2021\" class=\"citation arxiv cs1\">Zhongkai Shangguan; Zihe Zheng; Jiebo Luo (2021). \"What Kind of Person Wins the Turing Award?\". p.&#160;1. <a href=\"/wiki/ArXiv_(identifier)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"ArXiv (identifier)\">arXiv</a>:<span class=\"id-lock-free\" title=\"Freely accessible\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2104.05636\">2104.05636</a></span> [<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/archive/cs.GL\">cs.GL</a>]. <q>The youngest winner was Donald Knuth, who convinced the jury with \"Computer Programming as an Art\" and won [the] Turing Award in 1974 at the age of 36.</q></cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=preprint&amp;rft.jtitle=arXiv&amp;rft.atitle=What+Kind+of+Person+Wins+the+Turing+Award%3F&amp;rft.pages=1&amp;rft.date=2021&amp;rft&#95;id=info%3Aarxiv%2F2104.05636&amp;rft.au=Zhongkai+Shangguan&amp;rft.au=Zihe+Zheng&amp;rft.au=Jiebo+Luo&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3ATuring+Award\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-12\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-12\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFWilliam&#95;L.&#95;Hosch\" class=\"citation web cs1\">William L. Hosch. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.britannica.com/topic/Turing-Award\">\"Turing Award\"</a>. <a href=\"/wiki/Encyclopedia_Britannica\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Encyclopedia Britannica\">Encyclopedia Britannica</a>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20240205065404/https://www.britannica.com/topic/Turing-Award\">Archived</a> from the original on February 5, 2024<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">March 12,</span> 2024</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=Turing+Award&amp;rft.pub=Encyclopedia+Britannica&amp;rft.au=William+L.+Hosch&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.britannica.com%2Ftopic%2FTuring-Award&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3ATuring+Award\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-Allen-13\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-Allen_13-0\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite class=\"citation pressrelease cs1\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20070702034203/http://campus.acm.org/public/pressroom/press_releases/2_2007/turing2006.cfm\">\"First Woman to Receive ACM Turing Award\"</a> (Press release). The Association for Computing Machinery. February 21, 2007. Archived from <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://campus.acm.org/public/pressroom/press_releases/2_2007/turing2006.cfm\">the original</a> on July 2, 2007<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">November 5,</span> 2007</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=First+Woman+to+Receive+ACM+Turing+Award&amp;rft.pub=The+Association+for+Computing+Machinery&amp;rft.date=2007-02-21&amp;rft&#95;id=http%3A%2F%2Fcampus.acm.org%2Fpublic%2Fpressroom%2Fpress&#95;releases%2F2&#95;2007%2Fturing2006.cfm&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A